# T.R.A.C.E. Frontend Environment Configuration
# When running locally, leave VITE_API_BASE_URL unset or empty to use the Vite development proxy (/api -> http://127.0.0.1:8000).
# When deploying the frontend to production, set this to the base URL of your hosted FastAPI backend (e.g., https://api.trace-forensics.com).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
